<title>BRAZIL: Brazil govt sells only 39 pct in coffee auction.</title>
<headline>Brazil govt sells only 39 pct in coffee auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's government sold a total of 128,660 60-kg bags, or 39.44 percent of the 326,188 bags offered in its monthly auction today, said an official from Banco do Brasil, which held the electronic sale.</p>
<p>Total revenue from the auction was 16.05 million reais ($17 million), the official added.</p>
<p>Details of closing prices per lot would be available later, the official said.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
